---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Layout>
<main class="craft"><p class="eyebrow">THE CRAFT</p><h1>Material is<br />the <i>identity.</i></h1><section><div><span>01</span><h2>ORIGINAL FORM</h2><p>The geometry, proportions and character of the original emblem remain the starting point.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h2>ENAMEL</h2><p>Layered colour and metal create depth, gloss and a tactile finish designed to age beautifully.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h2>HAND FINISH</h2><p>Each piece is inspected, refined and finished as an individual object rather than a mass-produced accessory.</p></div></section></main>
</Layout>
<style>
:global(body){background:#e7e3d9;color:#171717;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.craft{padding:12vw 8vw}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;opacity:.5}.craft h1{font-size:clamp(65px,10vw,145px);font-weight:400;line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:80px 0 12vw}.craft h1 i{font-family:Georgia,serif}.craft section{border-top:1px solid #aaa;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.craft section>div{padding:35px 30px 100px 0;border-right:1px solid #aaa;margin-right:30px}.craft span{font-size:11px;opacity:.5}.craft h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:70px}.craft p{max-width:250px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;opacity:.6}@media(max-width:700px){.craft{padding:22vw 8vw}.craft section{grid-template-columns:1fr}.craft section>div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin:0;padding-bottom:60px}.craft h1{margin:70px 0 25vw}}
</style>